{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":48,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于摩押的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["关于摩押，以色列的上帝——万军之耶和华说：",{"text":"“尼波大祸临头了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它必被毁灭；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基列亭必蒙羞沦陷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堡垒必蒙羞被毁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押不再受称赞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敌人在希实本图谋害她，说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘来吧！我们铲除这个国家。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玛得缅啊，你也将变得死寂无声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀剑必追杀你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"“从何罗念传来呼喊声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘荒凉了！毁灭了！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押灭亡了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的孩童放声哀哭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人痛哭着走上鲁希坡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们在何罗念的下坡听见悲惨的哀号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃命吧！像灌木一样藏到旷野去吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押啊，你要被攻占，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你倚仗自己的成就和财富。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的神明基抹及供奉它的祭司和官长都要被掳去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭者必攻击每一座城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无一幸免；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山谷遭践踏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平原被毁坏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"正如耶和华所说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“给摩押翅膀让她飞走吧","poem":1},{"noteId":14},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她的城邑将沦为废墟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杳无人迹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不殷勤地为耶和华做工，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不挥刀斩杀摩押人的必受咒诅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“摩押自幼常享安逸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从未被掳到别处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像沉淀的酒没有被从这缸倒到那缸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"味道依旧，香气未变。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["“不过，看啊，时候将到，我要派倒酒的人去把她倒出来，倒空酒缸，把缸打碎。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["摩押人必因他们的神明基抹而羞愧，就像以色列人因信靠伯特利的神像而羞愧一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“摩押人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们怎能自称为骁勇善战的英雄呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押要灭亡了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑要被摧毁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她最勇敢的青年将被杀戮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是名叫万军之耶和华的君王说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押快要被毁灭了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的灾难就要来临。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的近邻和知道她名望的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们都要为她哀悼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘那强大、辉煌的权势竟然崩溃了！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"“底本的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要从荣耀的位子上下来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"坐在干旱的地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为毁灭摩押的要来攻击你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摧毁你们的堡垒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚罗珥的居民啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要站在路旁观望，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"询问逃难的男女究竟发生了什么事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们会得知摩押沦陷了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她羞愧难当。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们哀伤痛哭吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要在亚嫩河边宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘摩押被毁灭了！’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["“审判降临在平原上的何伦、雅杂、米法押、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["底本、尼波、伯·低比拉太音、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["基列亭、伯·迦末、伯·米恩、"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["加略、波斯拉等摩押远近各地的城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["摩押的权势被粉碎了，她的力量被摧毁了。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["“你们要灌醉她，因为她藐视耶和华。她必在自己的呕吐物中打滚，被人耻笑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["摩押啊，你不是曾经嘲笑以色列吗？以色列难道是强盗吗？你每次谈到她总是不屑地摇头。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"“摩押人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要离开城邑，住到岩洞里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鸽子在岩缝里筑巢一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们听说摩押傲气冲天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狂妄自大、心中高傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道摩押的狂傲不过是外强中干，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的夸耀不过是虚张声势。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要为她哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为摩押人痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为吉珥·哈列设人悲伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西比玛的葡萄树啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为你比为雅谢人哭得更悲痛！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的枝条虽然延伸到大海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一直到雅谢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但毁灭者已在蹂躏你夏日的果子和葡萄！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押的沃土上再没有欢喜快乐的声音。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使榨酒池不出酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再没有踩踏葡萄的欢呼声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"欢呼被呐喊取代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":["“哀哭声从希实本传到以利亚利和雅杂，又从琐珥传到何罗念和伊基拉·施利施亚，因为连宁林的水也干涸了。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":["耶和华说：“我要灭绝摩押那些在丘坛献祭和向他们神明烧香的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":["我的心为摩押悲鸣，好像凄凉的箫声；我的心为吉珥·哈列设人悲鸣，好像凄凉的箫声。他们的一切财富都消失了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":["他们都悲哀地剃去发须，割伤双手，腰束麻布。"]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":["在摩押境内的屋顶和街头巷尾，哀声处处可闻，因为我已把摩押打得粉碎，好像打碎没人要的器皿。这是耶和华说的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":["摩押破碎不堪！她嚎啕痛哭，羞愧难当，令四围的人嗤笑、惊惧。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":["耶和华说：",{"text":"“看啊，敌人必像展翅疾飞的大鹰一样来攻击摩押。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要攻取城池，占领堡垒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，摩押的勇士像临盆的妇人一样心惊胆战。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押必被摧毁，最后亡国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她藐视耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要充满恐惧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陷入深坑和网罗。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃过惊恐的必落入深坑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爬出深坑的必陷入网罗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我惩罚摩押的时候到了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":[{"text":"“在希实本的荫影下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃难的人无助地站着，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为希实本烈焰熊熊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西宏的城火光冲天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烧毁了摩押和其中的叛逆之人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押人啊，你们有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拜基抹神明的人灭亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的儿女都被掳去了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但将来，我要使摩押被掳的人返乡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对摩押的审判到此为止。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"“给摩押翅膀让她飞走吧，”或译作“给摩押竖起墓碑吧，因为她将被毁灭”或“在摩押撒盐吧，因为她将被毁灭”。","reference":{"chapter":48,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/48.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/49.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/47.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":47}